<html>
    <head>
            <meta charset="UTF-8">
            <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
            <title>Odyra Safaris - Booking Made</title>
            <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
            <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
            <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kumbh+Sans:wght,YOPQ@100..900,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
            <style>
                     /* Email client resets */
                     .ExternalClass, .ReadMsgBody{
                            width: 100%;
                            background-color: #f4f4f4;
                     }
                     body, table, td, p, a{
                          margin: 0;
                          padding: 0;
                          border: 0;
                     }
                     table{
                         border-collapse: collapse !important;
                     }
                     body{
                           font-family: "Kumbh Sans", 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial,  sans-serif;
                           background-color: #f4f4f4;
                           width: 100% !important;
                           height: 100% !important;
                     }

                    /* Custom font classes */
                    .font-primary {
                        font-family:  "Kumbh Sans", 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                    }
                      /* Mobile responsiveness */
                    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
                            .container {
                                width: 100% !important;
                            }
                            .button {
                                width: 100% !important;
                                display: block !important;
                            }
                    }
            </style>
   </head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: 'Kumbh Sans', 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
            <div style="display: block;">
                <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
                <p>Great news! We've successfully received your payment of  <strong><%= rideCost %> AUD</strong> for your upcoming ride with Odyra Safaris. Your booking is now fully confirmed and locked in.</p>
                 <h4>What to Expect Next?</h4>
                <p>The driver will give you a call to confirm your location, after which they'll proceed to pick you up</p>
                <div>
                         <h4>Booking Summary</h4>
                          <p>Pickup Location: <span><%= pickup %></span></p>
                          <p>Dropoff Location: <span><%= dropoff %></span></p>
                          <p>Scheduled Pickup Time: <span><%= date %></span></p>
                           <p>Booking ID: <%= bookingId %></p>
                </div>
                <br>
               <p>If you have questions or concerns, our friendly Customer Success Team is always ready to help!</p>
               <p>Send us an email at support@odyra.com.au</p><br>
               <p>Thank you for choosing Odyra Safaris</p><br>
               <p>The Odyra Safaris Team.</p>
            </div>
</body>
</html>